SUMMARY:Wellington County Black Heritage Society - Calabash Harvest Festival
DESCRIPTION:The Wellington County Black Heritage Society (WCBHS)\, a chapter of  the Guelph Black Heritage Society\, proudly announces the inaugural Calabash Harvest Fest\, taking place Saturday\, October 10\, 2026\, at the Rockmosa Community Centre in Rockwood.  \nRunning from 1:00 PM to 4:00 PM\, the festival will bring together music\, food\, heritage  education\, family activities including pumpkin carving\, and community pride in a vibrant  celebration of African\, Caribbean\, and Black Canadian culture. \nThe Calabash Harvest Festival showcases the rich cultural contributions of Black communities while welcoming residents from Guelph\, Fergus\, Elora\, Rockwood\, and beyond. The event  reflects the WCBHS mission to celebrate\, preserve\, and share Black history\, culture\, and  community throughout Wellington County. \n  \nREGISTER HERE. 
URL:https://ontariohistoricalsociety.ca/event/wellington-county-black-heritage-society-calabash-harvest-festival/
LOCATION:Rockmosa Community Centre\, 110 Rockmosa Drive\, Rockwood\, ON\, N0B 2K0\, Canada
END:VEVENT
