SUMMARY:Coptic Museum of Canada Fundraising Luncheon "From Pharaohs to Icons"
DESCRIPTION:Dear Friends and Supporters\, \nThe Coptic Museum of Canada warmly invites you to an inspiring afternoon exploring the fascinating connection between ancient Egyptian symbolism and modern Coptic art. \n FROM PHARAOHS TO ICONS: A FUNDRAISING LUNCHEON  \nJoin us to support the Coptic Museum of Canada while enjoying engaging keynote talks\, a delicious buffet lunch\, museum tours\, a silent auction\, and access to newly released museum shop items! \n Keynote Speakers (additional presentation details/topic to be communicated shortly) \n\nDr. Gayle Gibson — Egyptologist & Educator (25 years teaching at the Royal Ontario Museum)\nDr. Helene Moussa — Former Curator\, Coptic Museum of Canada\n\n Event Details & Schedule \n\nDate: Saturday\, October 17\, 2026\nTime: 12:00 PM – 4:00 PM\nLocation: Cultural Centre\, Coptic Museum of Canada\n\n41 Glendinning Avenue\, Toronto\, ON M1W 3E2 \n\nTickets: $30 per ticket\nDress Code: Semi-casual\n\nFeatured Activities: \n\nBuffet Lunch\nKeynote Talks\nMuseum Tours\nSilent Auction\nNewly Released Items\n\n How to Register & Purchase Tickets \nCome connect\, learn\, and celebrate the rich artistic heritage of Egypt and the Coptic tradition while helping support our ongoing mission! \nRegister Online \nWe look forward to welcoming you!
URL:https://ontariohistoricalsociety.ca/event/coptic-museum-of-canada-fundraising-luncheon-from-pharaohs-to-icons/
LOCATION:Coptic Museum of Canada\, 41 Glendinning Ave.\, Scarborough\, Ontario\, M1W 3E2
ORGANIZER;CN="Coptic Museum of Canada":MAILTO:copticmuseumcanada@gmail.com
GEO:43.8118337;-79.3325187
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Coptic Museum of Canada 41 Glendinning Ave. Scarborough Ontario M1W 3E2;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=41 Glendinning Ave.:geo:-79.3325187,43.8118337
