SUMMARY:Thunder Bay Historical Museum Society - Free Public Lecture: A Record of Time
DESCRIPTION:Join the Thunder Bay Museum on October 27 for our Free Public Lecture series event\, A Record of Time: Chronicling McVicar Creek Through Art\, with artists Betty Carpick and Julie Cosgrove. \nDiscover how local landscapes\, waterways\, and handmade art materials come together to tell stories about McVicar Creek and our region’s history\, whether you attend in person at the Museum or join us online. \nWe hope you will bring a friend\, your curiosity\, and be part of this engaging evening of art\, conversation\, and local history.
URL:https://ontariohistoricalsociety.ca/event/thunder-bay-historical-museum-society-free-public-lecture-a-record-of-time/
